<title>USA: Thermadyne Holdings Corp Q4 oper loss.</title>
<headline>Thermadyne Holdings Corp Q4 oper loss.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr loss	    $0.41     loss	 $6.03</p>
<p> Oper net loss	    4,463     loss	64,083</p>
<p> Revs			11,571		   76,632</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,944		   10,621</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 excludes loss of $1.3 million, or $0.12 a share from discontinued operations, compared to loss of $7.6 million or $0.72 a share a year ago.  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr loss	    $5.83     loss	$12.97</p>
<p> Oper net loss	   63,637     loss     160,800</p>
<p> Revs		     439,744		  316,778</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,797		   10,169</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full year 1996 excludes gain of $8.5 million, or from disposal of discontinued operations, loss of $5.5 million from discontinued operations and loss of $3.7 million for early extinguishment of debt. Including all these factors, net loss was $5.89 a share.</p>
<p>Full year 1995 excludes $29.0 million loss, or $0.72 a share, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
